@startuml
title UC01 - Customer Cancels Order\nFR07 | BR16 | NFR04/NFR05/NFR06
footer Nguyen Hai Trieu - 524H0072 | Group 3 | AI-assisted draft for owner review
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFCF5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FFF4DF
skinparam activityBorderColor #735344
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFE9A7
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #735344
skinparam ArrowColor #735344
|Customer|
start
:Request cancellation;
if (Confirm cancellation?) then (yes)
else (no)
 :Return to order details;
 stop
endif
|System|
:Check authentication, existence\nand ownership on server;
if (Authorized?) then (yes)
else (no)
 :Deny request; no data changed;
 stop
endif
if (Current state = Placed or Confirmed?) then (yes)
else (no)
 :Reject cancellation; show current state;
 stop
endif
if (Already paid online?) then (yes)
 :Prepare FULL simulated refund - BR16;
 if (Refund simulation successful?) then (yes)
 else (no)
  :Show refund error; retain original order\nand payment - D04 proposal;
  stop
 endif
else (no)
 :COD not collected: no refund needed;
endif
:Recheck cancellable state/version\nat the transaction boundary;
if (State/version still valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
 :Discard proposed result; reload;\ndo not cancel a newly Preparing order;
 stop
endif
:Save Cancelled + refund result if any\n+ history (from/to, actor and timestamp)\nin one transaction; retain lines/records;
if (Save successful?) then (yes)
 :Return Cancelled and refund outcome;
else (no)
 :Roll back; show error;\nretain original records;
endif
stop
legend bottom
  Successful online-paid cancellation refunds the FULL paid amount.
  D04 (simulation-error handling) remains a proposal for review.
  Kitchen rejection and Admin cancellation are HT03 actions.
endlegend
